Fri Nov  6 21:00:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of CopyQ 17.0.0
  * Built with Qt 6 and KDE Frameworks 6 (native notifications,
    tray icon and Wayland clipboard through KGuiAddons)
  * Tab encryption (QCA) and keyring integration (QtKeychain)
    enabled
  * Audio playback disabled: miniaudio is not packaged for Leap 16.0
  * GNOME Shell clipboard extension in a separate subpackage
